{"id": "DfXgLsFyQll", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Maa Lakshmi ki badi behen kaun hain, jinhe Diwali ki raat dhol bajakar ghar se nikala jaata hai?\n\nInka naam hai Alakshmi. Padma Purana mein likha hai ki Maa Lakshmi ne Bhagwan Vishnu se kaha, pehle meri badi behen ka vivah kijiye. Vivah muni Uddalak se hua, par ashram mein Ved ke mantra aur havan dekh kar Alakshmi dukhi ho gayin.\n\nPhir unhone khud bataya ki woh kahan rehti hain, aur kahan kabhi nahi rehti.\n\nAage kya hua, Part 2 mein.\n\nPart 1 of 2. Sources pinned comment mein hain.\n\nAapne Alakshmi ka naam pehle suna tha? 👇\n\n#diwali #lakshmi #lakshmipujan #hindumythology #sanatandharma", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793897641, "like_count": 142166, "comment_count": 319, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1667518141672568a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 57.303, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOmqLqALbbzsbTZ5171aIralHvOUvlAR5BlvNeyMMwGE244Jk00fB1LEX87zhi2NaH27AElFuw3-phLWTKqtGgLP4npVVXu1yOiZFQ.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Adrn9ty0QvBRBnfKGGwl7lmUoTWKDCNu102Hdw3dJLFVSfSAAkE81kyo-3ATbR-FxrXqcxr1DYW1FNTcpUmaRPmc&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=t6JGc1QgmVEQ7kNvwEaVli0&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=zFu0iC9F3jzkjBg6TwQAlw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQ06Ye80KGpy487IkvBd1XoU4HqQjoGEW-h4pl4PWBGTw&oe=6AF42582", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "